{
  "name": "loss_energy_based_cost_gap_sigmoid_stabilized",
  "intuition": "Replace unsupported 'advantage' signal with supported 'cost_gap' to comply with expectations, and simplify the energy calculation to integrate the log probability difference and cost gap. Apply sigmoid to the stabilized energy after clamping to avoid extreme values causing numerical instability. This ensures a valid, numerically stable pairwise energy-based loss using only allowed signals.",
